                                "sense_id": "814319f2-38ad-3e6d-9580-8af137e6d522",
                                "text": "[…] for on no other terms does she desire a reconciliation, but will sooner forego all the hopes to which her birth entitles her, and get her bread by service, than ever yield to become the wife of the ——."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0766b82-32cb-4dec-b0d0-d3a9140829c1",
                                "sense_id": "814319f2-38ad-3e6d-9580-8af137e6d522",
                                "text": "A study funded by the FMCSA found that although several heavy-vehicle manufacturers have voluntarily made AEB “standard” on many new truck models, they also offer “deletion credits” to customers who choose to remove AEB, which provides customers financial incentive to forego the technology and which ultimately reduces voluntary adoption rates"
